				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964752</guid>
				<title>███-3955</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964752/3955</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 29 Dec 2020 22:51:20 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Henzoid</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5190300</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><a href="https://youtu.be/zHE_n3XA9C8" target="_blank">Gravity drags me deep beneath the cavity in the rocky sand</a></strong><br /> <strong><a href="https://youtu.be/zHE_n3XA9C8" target="_blank">Blue turns to pitch black as I sink into the land</a></strong><br /> <strong><a href="https://youtu.be/zHE_n3XA9C8" target="_blank">Gravity renders me a ragdoll, tumbling to the chasm floor</a></strong><br /> <strong><a href="https://youtu.be/zHE_n3XA9C8" target="_blank">Looking up at the ceiling miles below the shore</a></strong></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Licensing&nbsp;Stuff</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Boo,&nbsp;did&nbsp;I&nbsp;scare&nbsp;ya?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>All images and music made by me, Henzoid.</p> <p>Huh, I guess I didn't really need a collapsible to say that, but here we are.</p> <p>Thanks Licensing Team! You guys rock.</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p>This SCP was written in honor of the lovely <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span> for the Holiday Gift-Swap. This gift was super fun to write, in part because Placeholder and I have near-identical taste in SCPs. In fact, though the main premise is brand new, I've been meaning to do a music SCP like this for quite some time, but never found the motivation. But, enough about me, here's to Placeholder MCD: An incredible author, and a lovely human being. Cheers!</p> <hr /> <p>Thanks to my gorgeous critters:<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crocket-lawnchair" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3205961&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Crocket_Lawnchair" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3205961)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crocket-lawnchair" >Crocket_Lawnchair</a></span><br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" >DarkStuff</a></span><br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brewsterion-1017" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3093017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Brewsterion 1017" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3093017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brewsterion-1017" >Brewsterion 1017</a></span><br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5226742&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Elunerazim" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5226742)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" >Elunerazim</a></span><br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Yossipossi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" >Yossipossi</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964703</guid>
				<title>Bear Flag Republic</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964703/bear-flag-republic</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 29 Dec 2020 21:05:20 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Its a Bad Idea</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3181609</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Written for the <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/t-13863495/9th-annual-holiday-art-exchange">9th Annual Art Exchange</a> for <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609304295" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span>. This is my admittedly silly take on what the big 'ol bear on the California Flag could mean in the context of the Obearwatch Command. For all you historyphobes out there, this takes place during California's short-lived sovereignty as an independent country before its assimilation into the United States. As a disclaimer, this does take some historic liberties for the purpose of making it fit Ralliston's request, but I tried to make it as accurate as possible while still retaining a story.</p> <p>Thank you for reading! Happy Holidays!</p> <p>Edit: Image Attributions</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">(please&nbsp;don't&nbsp;sue)</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">thanks</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Presidential seal - <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_presidential_seal_1850.png">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_presidential_seal_1850.png</a><br /> Flag - <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/80497449@N04/7392319712/in/photolist-cgez79-uzG4u-u2hYk6-s8gX5G-7n9GTH-7JVLXc-2c4vg9v-7JiNs6-8Vd5ZD-cpz16q-7JuJvR-7ndBmm-uFxzAL-u2qBb6-83orFT-ht95uv-9kY5wg-egSAof-Lw6kMt-p9aTpJ-7KdmFU-JWJTPr-7sSuC4-ebnSVj-7hQuRW-TvELBL-253ojPV-BqY1H2-djJdF-sovQ13-nj1pGf-2hmVxLj-ht94X9-htaogZ-ht95w4-htaod2-2hmUQQA-4HMSHZ-4HS6MY-uFG1XU-uFFPLA-uFFfdy-uWjgWh-uVXuih-8dsdp4-KzgcU2-QWLdCx-Kz6Eno-dy25pz-KzgcZT">https://www.flickr.com/photos/80497449@N04/7392319712/in/photolist-cgez79-uzG4u-u2hYk6-s8gX5G-7n9GTH-7JVLXc-2c4vg9v-7JiNs6-8Vd5ZD-cpz16q-7JuJvR-7ndBmm-uFxzAL-u2qBb6-83orFT-ht95uv-9kY5wg-egSAof-Lw6kMt-p9aTpJ-7KdmFU-JWJTPr-7sSuC4-ebnSVj-7hQuRW-TvELBL-253ojPV-BqY1H2-djJdF-sovQ13-nj1pGf-2hmVxLj-ht94X9-htaogZ-ht95w4-htaod2-2hmUQQA-4HMSHZ-4HS6MY-uFG1XU-uFFPLA-uFFfdy-uWjgWh-uVXuih-8dsdp4-KzgcU2-QWLdCx-Kz6Eno-dy25pz-KzgcZT</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <p>Critters: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tyumen" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2951719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609304295" alt="Tyumen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2951719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tyumen" >Tyumen</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609304295" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wizzblizz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6760712&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609304295" alt="WizzBlizz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6760712)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wizzblizz" >WizzBlizz</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609304296" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span></p> 
